  "verification_evidence": "chemically defined medium (MM: 4 g/l glucose, 34 mM NaH2PO4, 64 mM K2HPO4, 20 mM (NH4)2SO4, 1 μM Fe(SO4)4, 300 μM MgSO4, 1 μM ZnCl2, 10 μM CaCl2, adapted from (Tanaka et al, 1967))",
